*   **accel\_0\_60\_sec**: Varies by engine. C180 Kompressor around 9.2-9.5 seconds (Source [11, 17, 19, 20]), C200 Kompressor around 7.5-8.6 seconds (Source [7, 13, 16, 27]). These are around or slower than the 7.5s average. Score: -0.20.
